## Open-position supervision (Trading Desk)

Every broker open must have: GBP exit track + virtual stop + dynamic trail.

| Component | Role |
|-----------|------|
| `OpenPositionManager` | In-process daemon ~10s when agent up |
| `trade_support_wrapper` | Broker-authoritative supervisor (SoT for opens) |
| `manage_live_positions.py --supervise` | Offline/CLI: arm stack + flatten breaches |
| `GET /api/positions/live` | GUI — trust `verdict` / `broker_open_sot` / `critical`, not count alone |

**Operator commands:**
```bash
IG_AGENT_CONFIG=config/config_v31_demo_throughput.json \
  PYTHONPATH=src python3 scripts/manage_live_positions.py --supervise

IG_AGENT_CONFIG=config/config_v31_demo_throughput.json \
  PYTHONPATH=src python3 scripts/session_ready.py --start-agent
```

## Rotation + longer trades

- `dual_core.multi_source_auto_rotation: true` — 500ms DOW↔Nikkei sweep
- `long_trade_runner` — after 3m profit: 4R target, 40% giveback
- Open epics **pinned** on stack during rotation (no evict while live)

