## Safety

- Never `kill -9` main.py — use anti-zombie protocol from `.cursorrules`
- Learning DB `closed_at IS NULL` rows ≠ broker opens — run `reconcile_phantom_opens.py` after sessions
- `max_open_positions: 6` — desk enforces cap breach flatten via `enforce_cap_breach`
